:"She has been married for about three years to her husband. Just as we were discussing the possibility of having children, her husband became very busy. They have been having sex less and less often, and have been without each other for the past six months now. She is not able to actively seek out her own needs and is unaware that she is sexually frustrated."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from Getchu"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c98125"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の同僚の若妻。専業主婦。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人見知りをする性格。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"あまり気は強くなく、押しに弱く流されやすい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"結婚して３年くらい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そろそろ子供を…と話し合っていた矢先に夫が多忙になってしまった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"夫婦の営みも頻度が減り、半年前にはレス状態になっている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自分から積極的に求めることも出来ず、知らないうちに欲求不満を抱えている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"23684","sourceWorkId":"31263","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の同僚の若妻。専業主婦。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人見知りをする性格。あまり気は強くなく、押しに弱く流されやすい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"結婚して3年くらい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そろそろ子供を…と話し合っていた矢先に夫が多忙になってしまった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"夫婦の営みも頻度が減り、半年前にはレス状態になっている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自分から積極的に求めることも出来ず、知らないうちに欲求不満を抱えている。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"97646"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"98 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"23684","sourceWorkId":"31263","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"160 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"23684","sourceWorkId":"31263","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"88 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"23684","sourceWorkId":"31263","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"56 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"23684","sourceWorkId":"31263","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bis